# TestJavaToCSharpLangchain4j: langchain4j's core sources printed as C# by maddi-cst-print-csharp and judged by Roslyn
# (tools/csharp-check, Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.CSharp 5.0.0 on .NET 10; see JavaToCSharpRatchet's javadoc), the second
# corpus after fernflower. Lower is better for printerCrashes, syntaxErrors and unmappedJdkUses, higher for
# syntaxCleanFiles and compilingFiles; `types` must not move. Write a better value here in the commit that earns it.
#
# 2026-10-10, first record, with the printer as fernflower left it: 11 printer crashes (StackOverflowError), 57
# syntax errors in 11 files; 143 of 346 files compile; 1,249 errors (not ratcheted).
# 2026-10-10, an F-bounded type used raw (R extends GuardrailResult<R>) stops at its own erasure, which ended the 11
# crashes; a supplier argument a template calls is written in place (orElseGet(() -> x) is ?? x, orElseGet(List::of)
# is ?? new List<T>()); Optional.class: 0 crashes, 0 syntax errors, 151 files compile; errors 1,249 -> 1,374 and
# unmapped JDK uses 465 -> 670, as the 11 files that crashed are printed now.
# 2026-10-10, a namespace segment with a type's name is plural (Dev.Langchain4j.Exception hid System.Exception,
# Embedding, Query, Image, Tool: their types): 205 files compile; errors 1,374 -> 938.
# 2026-10-10, a default method called on a class goes through the interface; a cast to a type parameter through
# object; a method named as its class is Of (static) or <Name>Value; a type hidden by a member, or whose name two
# namespaces or the BCL declare, is qualified; an adapter substitutes a generic super-interface's arguments: 208 files
# compile; errors 938 -> 801.
# 2026-10-10, annotation types as attribute classes (8, which printed empty before), their uses as attributes, element
# reads as properties: errors 801 -> 793; the numbers do not move.
# 2026-10-10, a record with a canonical or compact constructor declares its properties and that constructor; an
# accessor implementing an interface method implements it explicitly: 209 files compile; errors 793 -> 791.
# 2026-10-10, List/Collection/Set/Iterable/Map of ? as C#'s non-generic IList/ICollection/IEnumerable/IDictionary
# (which a List<string> is, as a T extends Collection<?> needs): 214 files compile; errors 791 -> 772.
# 2026-10-10, interface implementations: a narrower return type implements the interface's method explicitly, a
# default method implements an inherited interface's method explicitly, an abstract class redeclares the interface
# methods it leaves (and its subclasses override them), clashing hoisted nested types are prefixed: 224 files
# compile; errors 772 -> 721.
types	346
printerCrashes	0
syntaxErrors	0
syntaxCleanFiles	346
compilingFiles	224
unmappedJdkUses	670
